What comes from STorm2600 (each file keeps its SPDX header; this directory
builds it as a variant of sd2snes_base with the MK2 and ATARI macros):
  - verilog/sd2snes_atari/   a26_core.v a26_i2s.v a26_mem.v a26_regs.v
                             a26_tdict.v a26_top.v a26_vidwr.v m6507.v
                             riot6532.v tia.v tia_audio.v (and the tia_*
                             helpers), the stub_*.v shims and config.vh
  - snes/atari/              the SNES-side player (atari_snes.s and its
                             generated tables)
  - src/atari.c              the Mk.II parts of the cartridge detection

Changes made in this repository (sd2snes+, by ludufre and contributors) are
recorded in its git history and are distributed under the same license.
